# Auth for the Claude Agent SDK.
#
# Option A — API key (works anywhere, billed to the key's org):
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# Option B — reuse your local Claude Code login (no key needed):
#   Leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY unset and run `claude login` once. The SDK
#   picks up the stored OAuth credentials automatically.
#
# This file is a template. Copy to `.env` and fill in if you use Option A.
# `.env` is git-ignored — never commit real secrets.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
